          <h1>

            <span class="line line-1">
              AEC production
            </span>

            <span class="line line-2">
              without the <br> <span class="accent">production friction.</span>
            </span>

          </h1>


          <!-- NEW (UX): PLAIN-WORDS LINE
               maqsad = heading industry ki zubaan mein hai; ye line aam banday ko
               pehle 5 second mein bata deti hai ke kaam kya hai. -->
          <p class="hero-lead">
            We turn architects' drawings into 3D models, renders and walkthroughs,
            so you can see the building before it's built.
          </p>


